<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's June unemployment rises to 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's June unemployment rises to 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's seasonally-adjusted unemployment rate in June rose to 2.5 percent from 2.1 percent a year earlier, provisional National Statistical Office (NSO) figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						 JUN 97 MAY 97  JUN 96</p>
<p>    Unemployment (pct)		     2.5    2.6     2.1</p>
<p>						  (2.3)  (2.5)   (1.9)</p>
<p>Note: Seasonally unadjusted figures in brackets.</p>
<p>The NSO figures showed the economically active population rose to 21.87 million in June from 21.46 million a year ago.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
